# Credentials - never commit
.env
.env.local
*.key

# Internal handover instructions for the maintainer. Contains local filesystem
# paths, is not one of the artifacts the paper promises, and is of no use to a
# reader of the repository. Kept in the working copy, not published.
HANDOVER.md

# Full, unreduced extraction. The published dataset in data/ is a deliberate
# subset; the full extraction is kept locally for follow-up work and must not
# be published. See README.md, "Scope of the published dataset".
full_text_screening_results.xlsx
full_text_screening_results.csv
full_text_screening_results_*.xlsx
