second_screening_results*.xlsx
screened_papers*.xlsx
filtered_papers.xlsx
converted_papers.xlsx
Include.xlsx
work/

# Local PDF corpus of the reviewed articles - copyrighted, not redistributable
papers/
*.pdf

# Source database exports (Scopus / IEEE Xplore RIS). Subject to the database
# providers' terms of use; not redistributable.
*.ris

# Regenerated figures. Not committed: 04_analysis_and_figures.py rebuilds them on
# demand, and the reconstruction differs from the published figures in two sector
# totals (see README, "Known discrepancies"). Shipping them would invite a
# comparison that the README already explains in words.
figures/

